<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A5.SS3" title="In Appendix E Experimental Setup Details ‣ Between a Rock and a Hard Place: Exploiting Ethical Reasoning to Jailbreak LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E.3 </span>Jailbreak Evaluation</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A6" title="In Between a Rock and a Hard Place: Exploiting Ethical Reasoning to Jailbreak LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F </span>TRIAL Attack Examples and Their Corresponding Scenarios</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
